<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY15-QA-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY15-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "Hardcoded production team literal atm-dev in member_mutation.rs test-fixture alias strings although TEST_TEAM is already imported and used in the same file" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r7 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, FINAL head 10bc123f8; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5575994618). arch-qa ARCH-001, carried and re-confirmed at 10bc123f8. crates/atm-core/src/team_admin/member_mutation.rs lines 1376, 1409, 1658, 1674 and 1708 build alias fixture strings such as worker_atm-dev and team-lead_atm-dev with the production team name embedded as a literal, while the same file already imports and uses the TEST_TEAM constant. Required correction: derive the fixture alias strings from TEST_TEAM (or a neutral fixture team) at all five sites and sweep the sprint's other new tests for the same literal." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ay" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "hygiene" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-core/src/team_admin/member_mutation.rs tests; other tests added by AY.15 that embed a production team name" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-07T22:05:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-09-07T22:10:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Confirmed fixed at phase-ay gate round 2 (PR #1308, integrate/phase-ay 0da9a26ec9f0493e5b2e6778ebf815efa8b78493). Independently re-verified by quality-mgr plus the round-2 reviewer set (req-qa, arch-qa, ruthless-boundary-qa) against live file:line evidence, not taken on a prior round's say-so." ;
